==Description== <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|24px]] '''Silk CubicNStarSurface_NStar66''' command creates a blended multi corner surface, a CubicNStarSurface_NStar66 object, from a [[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGridNStar66|blended corner grid]].

