==Usage== <!--T:6-->

<!--T:7-->
# Select a [[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGridNStar66|blended multi corner grid]].
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] CubicNStarSurface_NStar66}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] CubicNStarSurface_NStar66}} option from the menu.
# A blended multi corner surface, a '''CubicNStarSurface_NStar66''' object, is created.

== Properties == <!--T:8-->

<!--T:9-->
See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

<!--T:10-->
A  '''CubicNStarSurface_NStar66''' is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional property:

